{"id":"cfd147bb-e863-4e94-8358-a999549c857b","question":"What caused the Windows local startup failure and how is it addressed?","answer":"Reproduced that direct execution of scripts/start-local.ps1 is blocked because the effective PowerShell execution policy is Restricted (all scopes Undefined). Updated README to launch via powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\\\scripts\\\\start-local.ps1; this bypass is limited to that child process and does not persistently alter machine policy.","timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:51:24.198Z","tags":["how","local","powershell","startup","windows"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"medium","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"source":"cli","autoLink":{"checkedAt":"2026-10-26T07:51:24.198Z","result":"orphan"},"status":"active"},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:51:24.211Z","action":"created"}],"entities":{"technologies":["rest"],"patterns":[],"concepts":[]},"provenance":{"author":{"name":"eo657034-debug","email":"eo657034@gmail.com"},"source":"cli","timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:51:23.936Z"},"rev":1,"ts":"2026-10-26T07:51:24.262Z"}
