{"id":"9bcbe359-403c-4b4b-9398-d10becd0d5f0","question":"What caused the local migration failure shown in the screenshot?","answer":"The startup prompts were answered with text instead of pressing Enter for the displayed defaults; PGPORT became a non-numeric string and node-postgres failed with 'Port should be >= 0 and < 65536. Received type number (NaN)'. Updated the startup script to explicitly say to press Enter for defaults and validate a custom port before migration.","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:40:28.319Z","tags":["diagnosis","local","migration","node","postgres","windows"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"medium","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"source":"cli","autoLink":{"checkedAt":"2026-10-26T08:40:28.319Z","result":"orphan"},"status":"active"},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:40:28.325Z","action":"created"}],"entities":{"technologies":["postgres"],"patterns":[],"concepts":["migration"]},"provenance":{"author":{"name":"EDUSE"},"source":"cli","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:40:28.152Z"},"rev":1,"ts":"2026-10-26T08:40:28.336Z"}
