{"id":"1793077384074-m2gpn0","question":"What prevents the local server/API checks from completing in this run?","answer":"No project code failure was reproduced. The unit suite (39/39), TypeScript build, and frontend verification (19/19) pass. The public API check needs a running server, but startup currently stops at PostgreSQL authentication because PGPASSWORD and DATABASE_URL are unset in this process; pg reports `client password must be a string`. Per decision-63aa4b31-f161-408c-a254-50a864bfe84a and decision-404bd8bb-c7a1-4bfc-adb1-1a745a402e8b, local startup expects the owner to enter the PostgreSQL password securely through scripts/start-local.ps1. No password should be shared in chat or stored in files. After that script starts successfully, rerun /api/health and npm.cmd run check:public-api; only run booking API checks against a test/staging DB.","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:03:04.074Z","tags":["database","local","operational","postgres","runbook","startup","validation"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"medium","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"status":"active","source":"agent-mcp","client":"copilot-cli","trust":"unreviewed","entities":{"technologies":["typescript","postgres","postgresql"],"patterns":[],"concepts":["authentication","api","database"],"tools":["npm"]},"domain":"software","kind":"operational","runbook":{"prerequisites":["PostgreSQL is running and the wangui_beauty_bar database exists."],"steps":["Open PowerShell in the repository folder.","Run powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\scripts\\start-local.ps1.","Enter the PostgreSQL password only at the secure prompt; do not share or save it.","After the server starts, verify http://localhost:3000/api/health and run npm.cmd run check:public-api in another PowerShell window."],"docPath":"README.md"}},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:03:05.405Z","action":"created"}],"rev":1,"ts