{"id":"1793079675701-spocrc","question":"How will the owner manage gallery videos without developer edits?","answer":"The user chose an owner-only video dashboard using Supabase Auth and Supabase Storage, with PostgreSQL metadata. Restore owner sign-in and uploads that were previously removed (per decision-c7ff4a34), but keep the owner interface separate from public navigation. Owner scope: upload videos, edit title/caption/category, publish/unpublish, and delete. Use external durable media storage; do not persist uploads on Render's ephemeral filesystem. Document required Supabase configuration and storage access policies. No text-announcement or service/price editing is included unless requested later.","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:41:15.701Z","tags":["owner-dashboard","product","storage","supabase","video"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"high","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"status":"active","source":"agent-mcp","client":"copilot-cli","trust":"unreviewed","entities":{"technologies":["postgres","postgresql","supabase","rest"],"patterns":[],"concepts":["storage"],"tools":[]},"domain":"software"},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:41:16.452Z","action":"created"}],"rev":1,"ts":"2026-10-27T05:41:16.461Z"}
