{"id":"1793092379497-1qau0p","question":"How should the refined salon theme be applied across frontend components?","answer":"Applied the warm editorial palette throughout navigation, buttons, cards, service/contact/booking forms, gallery video cards, footer, and owner panels. Added accessible focus states and larger touch targets, responsive spacing and hero sizing, reduced-motion handling, and restored pointer events on the gallery play control so the play button remains usable.","timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:12:59.497Z","tags":["accessibility","design","frontend","responsive","styling"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"medium","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"status":"active","source":"agent-mcp","client":"copilot-cli","trust":"unreviewed","entities":{"technologies":["rest"],"patterns":[],"concepts":[],"tools":[]},"domain":"software"},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:13:00.836Z","action":"created"}],"rev":1,"ts":"2026-10-27T09:13:00.852Z"}
