{"id":"58479e92-96dd-4519-8393-1c4ed251c277","question":"How was the responsive salon styling prepared for deployment?","answer":"Committed only css/components.css and css/variable.css as 7b3dc6d (Polish responsive salon frontend styling), preserving unrelated worktree edits. Push was attempted but this command environment cannot prompt for GitHub credentials; the user must push from their authenticated interactive terminal.","timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:51:02.576Z","tags":["deployment","design","frontend","github","how"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"medium","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"source":"cli","autoLink":{"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T09:51:02.576Z","result":"orphan"},"status":"active"},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:51:02.609Z","action":"created"}],"entities":{"technologies":["github"],"patterns":[],"concepts":[]},"provenance":{"author":{"name":"eo657034-debug","email":"eo657034@gmail.com"},"source":"cli","timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:51:02.228Z"},"rev":1,"ts":"2026-10-27T09:51:02.641Z"}
