{"id":"1793184959341-c3qs29","question":"Why does the Render staging Blueprint install dependencies with npm ci --include=dev?","answer":"The staging Blueprint now installs from package-lock.json and explicitly includes devDependencies so the TypeScript compiler required by npm run build is present even when the deploy environment is production. The existing staging plan and Supabase configuration are otherwise unchanged.","timestamp":"2026-10-28T10:55:59.341Z","tags":["build","deployment","render","staging"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"high","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"status":"active","source":"agent-mcp","client":"Visual Studio Code","trust":"unreviewed","entities":{"technologies":["typescript","supabase"],"patterns":[],"concepts":[],"tools":["npm"]},"domain":"software","autoLink":{"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T10:55:59.815Z","result":"orphan"}},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T10:55:59.601Z","action":"created"}],"rev":2,"ts":"2026-10-28T10:55:59.822Z"}
{"id":"1793185201297-2syhns","question":"Why add a separate Render production Blueprint instead of changing the existing staging service?","answer":"The existing Render Blueprint intentionally provisions free staging with external Supabase PostgreSQL. Render documents free web services and free Postgres as unsuitable for production; free web apps spin down and free databases expire without backups. A separate render.production.yaml preserves staging and provides an explicit paid production path with a private Render Postgres database, paid always-on compute, a pre-deploy migration, and a DB-backed health check. Operators still need to review current costs, provision/configure Supabase media/Auth, validate backup/restore, and approve the launch before syncing it.","timestamp":"2026-10-28T11:00:01.297Z","tags":["deployment","postgres","production","render","staging"],"files":[],"status":"active","priority":"high","relationships":{"supersedes":[],"supersededBy":[],"relatedTo":[],"causes":[],"causedBy":[]},"metadata":{"status":"active","source":"agent-mcp","client":"Visual Studio Code","trust":"unreviewed","entities":{"technologies":["postgres","postgresql","supabase","rest"],"patterns":[],"concepts":["migration","database"],"tools":[]},"domain":"software"},"commitHashes":[],"history":[{"timestamp":"2026-10-28T11:00:01.591Z","action":"created"}],"rev":1,"ts":"2026-10-28T11:00:01.602Z"}
